<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy 18-mo CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.0 trillion lire auction of a first tranche of 18-month December 30, 1998 Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ), and 3.0 trillion lire auction of a seventh tranche of May 14, 1999 two-year CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Dec 30, 98  Pvs    May 14, 99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 5.31 pct    5.68   5.29 pct    5.69</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.06	  6.51   6.08	  6.48</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.55	 91.95  89.55	 88.70</p>
<p>Bids	     5.41 trillion lire   5.35 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 2.00 trillion lire   3.00 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - For the 18-month CTZ, results compare with the fifth tranche of October 15, 1998 CTZs auctioned on June 11 while the two-year paper results compare with a previous tranche of the same May 1999 paper.</p>
</text>
